<title>SWITZERLAND: Basle January inflation falls to 1.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Basle January inflation falls to 1.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Basle, Switzerland's second largest city, rose 0.3 percent in January from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 1.0 percent, the city's statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Jan 1997	Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change    0.3 pct	 0.1 pct	 0.3 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		 1.0 pct	 1.0 pct	 1.6 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  104.3	   104.0	   103.3</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +4 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
